{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07679","headline":"题云门山寄越府包户曹徐起居 · 孟浩然","name":"题云门山寄越府包户曹徐起居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我行适诸越，梦寐怀所欢。\n久负独往愿，今来恣游盘。\n台岭践磴石，耶溪泝林湍。\n舍舟入香界，登阁憩旃檀。\n晴山秦望近，春水镜湖宽。\n远怀伫应接，卑位徒劳安。\n白云日夕滞，沧海去来观。\n故国眇天末，良朋在朝端。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07679.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07679","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}